ue at the *top right corner* of each subregion. \n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14072435/assets/6e58954fccd74eaf67c95df818c4c9050c35b324c5fffe4902a366cb295b8845.png)\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{M}_{ij} & =f({x}_{i},{y}_{j})=4{x}_{i}+5{y}_{j}+23\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nfor all $1\\le i\\le m$ and $1\\le j\\le n.$\n\nFinally, the upper Riemann sum is \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}U(f,P) & ={\\sum }_{i=1}^{m}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{n}(4{x}_{i}+5{y}_{j}+23)Δ{x}_{i}Δ{y}_{j}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, the missing expression is $4{x}_{i}+5{y}_{j}+23.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14072435/state.json" "file_sha256" "06c0ee19ab86b5aed06adc4228a7233ec9d5a0640b4cc5c65c00930a8c8969de"} {"question" "q-75331" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14072435/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "18eb505175667323fde6f9af69c08706940547b7d0442dc38309563563f6e641"} {"question" "q-75331" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14072435/state.json" "file_sha256" "06c0ee19ab86b5aed06adc4228a7233ec9d5a0640b4cc5c65c00930a8c8969de"} {"question" "q-75331" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "4{x}_{i-1}+5{y}_{j-1}+23"] ["math" "4{x}_{i-1}+5{y}_{j}+23"] ["math" "4{x}_{i}+5{y}_{j}+23"] ["math" "{x}_{i-1}+5{y}_{j-1}"] ["math" "{x}_{i}+5{y}_{j}"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14072435/state.json" "file_sha256" "06c0ee19ab86b5aed06adc4228a7233ec9d5a0640b4c